[QWidget::keyPressEvent](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwidget.html#keyPressEvent)(QKeyEvent
\\*event).

This function handles keyboard input.

The following keys are handled specifically:

| Enter/Return | This will reinterpret the text and emit a signal even if the value has not changed since last time a signal was emitted. |
| --- | --- |
| Up | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(1) |
| Down | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(-1) |
| Page up | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(10) |
| Page down | This will invoke [stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)(-10) |

**See also**
[stepBy](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#stepBy)().

