### `[protected]` void QAbstractSpinBox::setLineEdit([QLineEdit](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qlineedit.html) \\**lineEdit*)

Sets the line edit of the spinbox to be *lineEdit* instead of the current line edit
widget. *lineEdit* cannot be `nullptr`.

[QAbstractSpinBox](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html) takes
ownership of the new
[lineEdit](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractspinbox.html#lineEdit)

If [QLineEdit::validator](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qlineedit.html#validator)()
for the *lineEdit* returns `nullptr`, the internal validator of the spinbox will be set
on the line edit.

