### `[signal]` void QAction::toggled(bool *checked*)

This signal is emitted whenever a checkable action changes its
[isChecked](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qaction.html#checked-prop)() status. This
can be the result of a user interaction, or because
[setChecked](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qaction.html#checked-prop)() was called.
