the [QAction](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qaction.html), it emits
[changed](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qaction.html#changed)() in addition to
toggled().

*checked* is true if the action is checked, or false if the action is unchecked.

**Note:** Notifier signal for property
[checked](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qaction.html#checked-prop).

