[completionColumn](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qcompleter.html#completionColumn-prop)().

Ensure that this function is called before the view settings are modified. This is
required since view's properties may require that a model has been set on the view (for
example, hiding columns in the view requires a model to be set on the view).

