    'Qt 5 reference:\n\n### maximumDate : [QDate](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdate.html)\n\nThis property holds the maximum date of the date time edit.\n\nChanging this property updates the date of the\n[maximumDateTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumDateTime-prop)\nproperty while preserving the\n[maximumTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumTime-prop)\nproperty. When setting this property, the\n[minimumDate](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#minimumDate-prop) is\nadjusted, if necessary, to ensure that the range remains valid. When this happens, the\n[minimumTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#minimumTime-prop)\nproperty is also adjusted if it is greater than the\n[maximumTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumTime-prop)\nproperty. Otherwise, changes to this property preserve the\n[minimumDateTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#minimumDateTime-prop)\nproperty.\n\nThis property can only be set to a valid\n[QDate](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdate.html) object describing a date on which\nthe current\n[maximumTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumTime-prop)\nproperty makes a valid [QDateTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetime.html)\nobject. The latest date that setMaximumDate() accepts is the end of 9999 CE. This is the\ndefault for this property. This default can be restored with\n[clearMaximumDateTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumDateTime-prop)().\n\n**Access functions:**\n\n| QDate | **maximumDate**() const |\n| --- | --- |\n| void | **setMaximumDate**(const QDate \\&*max*) |\n| void | **clearMaximumDate**() |\n\n**See also**\n[minimumDate](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#minimumDate-prop),\n[maximumTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumTime-prop),\n[maximumDateTime](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumDateTime-prop),\n[setDateRange](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#setDateRange)(),\n[QDate::isValid](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdate.html#isValid)(), and [Keyboard\nTracking](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#keyboard-tracking).\n\nSource: https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qdatetimeedit.html#maximumDate'
