Qt 5 reference:

### void QDoubleSpinBox::setRange(double *minimum*, double *maximum*)

Convenience function to set the *minimum* and *maximum* values with a single function
call.

Note: The maximum and minimum values will be rounded to match the decimals property.

```
setRange(minimum, maximum);
```

is equivalent to:

```
setMinimum(minimum);
setMaximum(maximum);
```

