[QMAKE\\_INFO\\_PLIST](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmake-variable-reference.html#qmake-info-plist)
in the project file must contain the key `NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription`. See
Info.plist documentation from Apple for more information regarding this key. This
feature was added in Qt 5.5.

