### void QFocusFrame::setWidget([QWidget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwidget.html#QWidget) \\**widget*)

[QFocusFrame](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qfocusframe.html) will track changes to
*widget* and resize itself automatically. If the monitored widget's parent changes,
[QFocusFrame](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qfocusframe.html) will follow the
widget and place itself around the widget automatically. If the monitored widget is
deleted, [QFocusFrame](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qfocusframe.html) will set it
to zero.

**See also**
[QFocusFrame::widget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qfocusframe.html#widget)().

