### `[virtual protected]` void QGraphicsEffect::sourceChanged([QGraphicsEffect::ChangeFlags](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicseffect.html#ChangeFlag-enum) *flags*)

This virtual function is called by
[QGraphicsEffect](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicseffect.html) to notify the
effect that the source has changed. If the effect applies any cache, then this cache
