horizontally and vertically when arranged in a layout.

[QGraphicsLayoutItem](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicslayoutitem.html)'s
default size policy is
([QSizePolicy::Fixed](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qsizepolicy.html#Policy-enum),
