### [QRect](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrect.html) QGraphicsView::rubberBandRect() const

This functions returns the current rubber band area (in viewport coordinates) if the
user is currently doing an itemselection with rubber band. When the user is not using
the rubber band this functions returns (a null) QRectF().

Notice that part of this [QRect](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrect.html) can be
outise the visual viewport. It can e.g contain negative values.

This function was introduced in Qt 5.1.

