    "Qt 5 reference:\n\n### foregroundBrush : [QBrush](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qbrush.html)\n\nThis property holds the foreground brush of the scene.\n\nThis property sets the foreground brush for the scene in this view. It is used to\noverride the scene's own foreground, and defines the behavior of\n[drawForeground](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#drawForeground)().\nTo provide custom foreground drawing for this view, you can reimplement\n[drawForeground](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#drawForeground)()\ninstead.\n\nBy default, this property contains a brush with the\n[Qt::NoBrush](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qt.html#BrushStyle-enum) pattern.\n\n**Access functions:**\n\n| QBrush | **foregroundBrush**() const |\n| --- | --- |\n| void | **setForegroundBrush**(const QBrush \\&*brush*) |\n\n**See also**\n[QGraphicsScene::foregroundBrush](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsscene.html#foregroundBrush-prop)\nand\n[backgroundBrush](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#backgroundBrush-prop).\n\nSource: https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qgraphicsview.html#foregroundBrush"
