If *movable* is true, the header sections may be moved by the user; otherwise they are
fixed in place.

When used in combination with
[QTreeView](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtreeview.html), the first column is not
movable (since it contains the tree structure), by default. You can make it movable with
[setFirstSectionMovable](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qheaderview.html#firstSectionMovable-prop)(true).

This function was introduced in Qt 5.0.

**See also**
[sectionsMovable](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qheaderview.html#sectionsMovable)(),
[sectionMoved](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qheaderview.html#sectionMoved)(), and
