Implemented in subclasses to add an *item*. How it is added is specific to each
subclass.

This function is not usually called in application code. To add a widget to a layout,
use the [addWidget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qlayout.html#addWidget)()
function; to add a child layout, use the addLayout() function provided by the relevant
[QLayout](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qlayout.html) subclass.

**Note:** The ownership of *item* is transferred to the layout, and it's the layout's
responsibility to delete it.

