### [QAbstractButton](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qabstractbutton.html) \\*QMessageBox::clickedButton() const

Returns the button that was clicked by the user, or `nullptr` if the user hit the
**Esc** key and no [escape
button](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmessagebox.html#setEscapeButton) was set.

If [exec](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qmessagebox.html#exec)() hasn't been called
yet, returns nullptr.

