### bool QOpenGLShaderProgram::bind()

Binds this shader program to the active
[QOpenGLContext](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qopenglcontext.html) and makes it
the current shader program. Any previously bound shader program is released. This is
equivalent to calling `glUseProgram()` on
[programId](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qopenglshaderprogram.html#programId)().
Returns `true` if the program was successfully bound; false otherwise. If the shader
program has not yet been linked, or it needs to be re-linked, this function will call
[link](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qopenglshaderprogram.html#link)().

**See also** [link](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qopenglshaderprogram.html#link)()
and [release](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qopenglshaderprogram.html#release)().

