### void QPainter::drawText(const [QRect](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrect.html) \\&*rectangle*, int *flags*, const [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) \\&*text*, [QRect](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrect.html) \\**boundingRect* \\= nullptr)

This is an overloaded function.

Draws the given *text* within the provided *rectangle* according to the specified
*flags*.

