### bool QRect::contains(const [QPoint](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qpoint.html) \\&*point*, bool *proper* \\= false) const

Returns `true` if the given *point* is inside or on the edge of the rectangle, otherwise
returns `false`. If *proper* is true, this function only returns `true` if the given
*point* is *inside* the rectangle (i.e., not on the edge).

**See also** [intersects](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qrect.html#intersects)().

