### void QScrollArea::ensureVisible(int *x*, int *y*, int *xmargin* \\= 50, int *ymargin* \\= 50\\)

Scrolls the contents of the scroll area so that the point (*x*, *y*) is visible inside
the region of the viewport with margins specified in pixels by *xmargin* and *ymargin*.
If the specified point cannot be reached, the contents are scrolled to the nearest valid
position. The default value for both margins is 50 pixels.

