[QScrollArea::widget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qscrollarea.html#widget)() is
visible inside the viewport with margins specified in pixels by *xmargin* and *ymargin*.
If the specified point cannot be reached, the contents are scrolled to the nearest valid
position. The default value for both margins is 50 pixels.

This function was introduced in Qt 4.2.

