### void QScrollArea::setWidget([QWidget](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwidget.html#QWidget) \\**widget*)

Sets the scroll area's *widget*.

The *widget* becomes a child of the scroll area, and will be destroyed when the scroll
