to the width and height using the
[rwidth](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qsizef.html#rwidth)() and
[rheight](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qsizef.html#rheight)() functions. Finally,
the width and height can be swapped using the
