[QStateMachine::SignalEvent](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstatemachine-signalevent.html)
is part of [The State Machine
Framework](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/statemachine-api.html).

The [sender](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstatemachine-signalevent.html#sender)()
function returns the object that generated the signal. The
[signalIndex](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstatemachine-signalevent.html#signalIndex)()
function returns the index of the signal. The
[arguments](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstatemachine-signalevent.html#arguments)()
function returns the arguments of the signal.

