signal will emitted when this occurs.

Note that display of messages are dependent on the system configuration and user
preferences, and that messages may not appear at all. Hence, it should not be relied
upon as the sole means for providing critical information.

On Windows, the *millisecondsTimeoutHint* is usually ignored by the system when the
application has focus.

Has been turned into a slot in Qt 5.2.

This function was introduced in Qt 4.3.

