### void QWizardPage::setFinalPage(bool *finalPage*)

Explicitly sets this page to be final if *finalPage* is true.

After calling setFinalPage(true),
[isFinalPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#isFinalPage)() returns
`true` and the **Finish** button is visible (and enabled if
[isComplete](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#isComplete)() returns
true).

After calling setFinalPage(false),
[isFinalPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#isFinalPage)() returns
`true` if [nextId](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#nextId)() returns
-1; otherwise, it returns `false`.

**See also**
[isFinalPage](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#isFinalPage)(),
[isComplete](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qwizardpage.html#isComplete)(), and
