### void QXmlQuery::bindVariable(const [QString](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qstring.html) \\&*localName*, const [QXmlItem](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qxmlitem.html) \\&*value*)

